{"id":"c3259dc845","t":"Milady: Memoirs of the Villainess","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/images-1-193x278.jpg","n":31,"l":31,"s":["ml","az"],"k":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess"},"u":1795077166417,"desc":"أثناء عملها كجاسوسة، وقعت ميليدي في حب عدوها دارتانيان. وبينما كانت مطاردة من قِبل فرقة الفرسان، طلبت مساعدته، لكنها اكتشفت أن كل ما حدث لم يكن سوى جزء من خطته. غمرها شعور هائل بالخيانة والغضب، وانتهى بها الأمر إلى موت مأساوي وهي تطلق صرخة يائسة… لكن بينما كانت ميليدي تفقد الأمل وتستسلم لليأس، بدأ القدر من جديد…","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["تجسيد","رومانسى"],"src":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/manga/milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess/1/","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/series/milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/manga/milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess/2/","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/series/milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess/chapter-2"},"3":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/manga/milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess/3/","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/series/milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess/chapter-3"},"4":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/manga/milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess/4/","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/series/milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess/chapter-4"},"5":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/manga/milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess/5/","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/series/milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess/chapter-5"},"6":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/manga/milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess/6/","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/series/milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess/chapter-6"},"7":{"ml":"milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/manga/milady-memoirs-of-the-villainess/7/","az":"milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess|/series/milady:-memoirs-of-the-villainess/c